{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "e45509fa08c2a54706f7e0809c50400e41ccb8f33f01c70bb0425d5af087396a", "ja": "優しい★パートナー", "zh": "温柔★搭档", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "92d50967414c3dc1f3bdb96d998cb8276a093bd8f6daccb829649d4994306f59", "ja": "イベント当日。茜の体調を気づかい、プリン\nを差し入れする優しい麗花。プロデューサー\nもみんなも疑問に思わない……居た堪れなく\nなった茜は走り去り、麗花は茜を追っていっ\nた。その時、みんなの心に何かが……？", "zh": "活动当天。温柔的丽花体贴茜的身体状况，\n给她送来了布丁。制作人和大家都没有觉得\n奇怪……茜感到坐立难安，跑了出去，丽花\n也追了上去。就在那时，大家的心中似乎有\n什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "aacd00d13648478e6a83e022dcb46d608b9db65fea983eee77446ac18f4ff2a6", "ja": "ハロウィンブラックパーティー、当日……", "zh": "万圣节黑色派对当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "0b0d55373e15b854780eb47c117d2589d47c73f8d5d691ba2a4d4ebbc21b6c13", "ja": "ふっふっふ……。\n見てよ{$P$}ちゃん、この会場！", "zh": "呵呵呵……  \n快看啊，{$P$}，这个会场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "f3690a0635856f948f226e5f83db3155e0f79bca948f38e902339a75e6e30d24", "ja": "あっちにも茜ちゃん人形、こっちにも茜ちゃん人形！\n茜ちゃんだらけの、茜ちゃんパラダイス☆", "zh": "那边也是小茜玩偶，这边也是小茜玩偶！\n简直就是小茜的小茜天堂☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "e61d0e0f1b7faf2a239904ad674e389a6f71ade4d190dbe3289e7c9c3333ddf8", "ja": "目玉の限定スイーツはカワイイ『茜ちゃんプリン』！\n限定100万セット即完売間違いナシだよ！", "zh": "主打的限定甜点是可爱的“小茜布丁”！\n限定100万套，肯定会瞬间售罄哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c5c9f1b37797d441bed7611bca3ee8c730537b4b3428047047bf9b87f6beb039", "ja": "ああ！　アンバサダーとして、よくやってくれた。\n麗花も、色々フォローしてくれてありがとう。", "zh": "啊！作为形象大使，你做得很好。\n丽花，也谢谢你帮了不少忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "f281c7aa405933f8071560f43db87c1a01419d22ef45271ac369006138835e5e", "ja": "いいえ、私もとっても楽しかったので。\n茜ちゃんが考えた特製プリン、反応が楽しみですね！", "zh": "不是的，我也玩得特别开心。  \n不知道大家会对小茜特制的布丁作何反应，真让人期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "7d5d2bf0340f68e084542973f0113a01427d95555d35e139cc29221244403d6e", "ja": "お客さんたち、よろこんでくれるかな？\nきっと大人気になると思うよ。", "zh": "客人们会喜欢吗？\n我觉得一定会大受欢迎的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "3e0894fdfd42f80f41a00db8fce8cd1dc5f9f5ac012d9a4d5ca6cd005046b69b", "ja": "う、うん……でも麗花ちゃん、本当に\n『麗花ちゃんプリン』は作らなくてよかったの？", "zh": "呜、嗯……不过丽花，真的不用做\n“丽花布丁”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "9411f08e021e0754fe23a1390d0af276976e0ac66cb7a441755a80faeb2eb8b5", "ja": "いいの。今日は茜ちゃんの、茜ちゃんによる、\n茜ちゃんのためのフェスティバルだもん。", "zh": "没关系。今天可是属于小茜、由小茜举办、为小茜而设的庆典呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "5f4d36e0a67f25c9ad5f21905152f277f463fb5d17ac6b7cdbfe91daf5964fb8", "ja": "私は、かわいい茜ちゃんをみんなに\n見てもらえたら、それで満足なんだよ。", "zh": "只要能让大家看到可爱的小茜，我就满足了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "3913f19d6658eae9492d857077722c90c19f6d71960288caad16f9e9dbac6eec", "ja": "はい、茜ちゃん。差し入れの『茜ちゃんプリン』。\nこれを食べて、がんばろうね！", "zh": "好的，小茜。这是慰问品『小茜布丁』。吃了这个，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "8d4562c6baaaeab86e4685ebf6121a0afd3c75195b4c4d551921425469c62a4a", "ja": "あ、ありがと……いやー、なんか悪いな～。\nあは、あははは、は……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……哎呀，总觉得有点不好意思啊～  \n啊哈，啊哈哈哈，哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "14953bd7570d0c736d97672dc4fd03c5d0b3731907aef267ee6aafd411aeba2a", "ja": "{$P$}。\nパレード、開始30分前だそうですよ。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n据说游行再过30分钟就要开始了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "07de19d97f0e3bcf0b41f030fab4dc6bc4800c3539580eac39214c985466eea4", "ja": "ありがとう、律子。すまないな、結局、\n当日も手伝ってもらうことになってしまって。", "zh": "谢谢你，律子。真不好意思，结果\n当天也还是要麻烦你来帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "b4e724c97e632074a6f053e8475d52d5916428242022214020a94956c7ad6938", "ja": "これくらい、お安い御用ですよ。それに\n麗花さんがいてくれたから、こっちも楽でしたし。", "zh": "这点小事，不值一提。而且有丽花小姐在，也让我们轻松了不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b1a5a16d9c03f0504c4ad3f1a616f43e30c1bdadf37fc2fe752c3744009173a5", "ja": "一般参加の人たちの様子を見てきましたけど、\nみんな本格的な仮装で、びっくりしちゃいました。", "zh": "我去看了看普通参加者的情况，大家都穿着很正式的变装，真是让我大吃一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "321b43eaa8c10b73f6e41fbe5d8819b1d750a088a63427346c7ea330cd2c8a30", "ja": "セクシーな衣装の子も、思ったより多かったわね。\nやっぱり私も、もうちょっと胸元を……。", "zh": "穿着性感服装的女孩子也比我想象中多呢。\n果然我也该在胸口这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "ed57c16676ad70780d08ac32561283778fbb139429b050b3abea353582efe3dd", "ja": "そんなことしなくたって、莉緒さんは\nとってもセクシーですよ？　だから大丈夫です。", "zh": "就算不那样做，莉绪姐也已经非常性感了哦？所以没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "8a2973edd8c474e74c973ec43bc8196fa5deac9025880ba3ceef46782cc4f63b", "ja": "あ、あら、そうかしら？\nありがと、麗花ちゃん。ウフフ♪", "zh": "啊、啊啦，是这样吗？\n谢谢你，丽花。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "84b62ad56220c9dcd140789305fe7d86851c79888d0ef2f62213f2f9ad311f3a", "ja": "茜、どうかしたの？　もうすぐイベントが\n始まるのに、いつになく暗い顔してるじゃない。", "zh": "茜，你怎么了？活动马上就要开始了，你今天的表情看起来格外阴郁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "9f9527537fc334f177938edd496b3d0ff63f561b5f429b881cb381baf51a75e5", "ja": "えっ？　ま、まさか～！\n茜ちゃんが暗い顔なんて、ナイナイ！", "zh": "诶？不、不会吧～！\n小茜怎么可能愁眉苦脸，才不会呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "35539806cac607f3cdc067961d0b97fecbe9a1be8e3473040375b255b613e5a8", "ja": "元始、茜ちゃんは太陽であった！　茜ちゃんの輝きは、\n宇宙の隅々まで照らし出すのだ～！　なんて……。", "zh": "起初，小茜是太阳！小茜的光辉，将照亮宇宙的每个角落～！什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "1e3b91da895f313f54a160b60afeca8c0b7d3dcb92cb70b031ec8df68d966629", "ja": "ふふっ。茜ちゃんは、いつも面白いね。茜ちゃんの\n明るさは、本当に太陽みたいだと思うな♪", "zh": "呵呵。小茜总是很有趣呢。小茜的开朗，真的就像太阳一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3b89ab820f009036b5fd1c1e66def1be05bd3562cb5424f8c03f971f44f989fa", "ja": "茜？　本当に、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "茜？你到底怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "28630bb1fc2fd4246f244970c4167e439c66c12bd2c0d3f6c325d504acc5b5a0", "ja": "そうだけど、違うんだよ！　だって麗花ちゃんは……\n麗花ちゃんは、もっと……うう～っ……。", "zh": "是这样没错，但不是那回事啦！因为丽花她……  \n丽花她，应该更加……呜呜～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "3fc54602f031b653615ed7597687b2921adba37e9f1af0266db5fa09ae326961", "ja": "やっぱり……やっぱり、こんなのダメだよ～っ！！", "zh": "果然……果然这样不行啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "0e5cf6221db79a13fcbe36646d369b61ec14005543c92b0bf48d81b14e22b827", "ja": "お、おい、茜！？　どこに行くんだ！\nもうすぐ本番が始まるんだぞ！", "zh": "喂、喂，茜！？你要去哪儿！\n正式演出马上就要开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "db868badc51ba77aef2fe8d4854a7881f11bb539749e3dd4d9b9d10dfd8882b2", "ja": "茜ちゃん……。\n私、追いかけますね。", "zh": "小茜……。\n我去追她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "eef4b6c9226548d0fc7bbfba9d82dc8f8d537c00d57e546f69fb085993c065af", "ja": "あっ、麗花さん！？", "zh": "啊，丽花小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "8c030883b2cf56f55ed97d0f1793139050bc30ee216af3b0fd9559a0aedf6d79", "ja": "ふたりとも、いったいどうしちゃったのかしら？", "zh": "你们两个到底是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "6a00cef555d0a6af40f3fc70ef3d8c0ed2d1a3ea72b11d7f8c0ce620a9e8fdbd", "ja": "その事なんだけど……なあ、みんな。\n最近、何か変だったと思わないか？", "zh": "关于那件事……我说啊，大家。\n你们不觉得最近有些奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "86db2b4d97f4bd1796f604c201cb1529aab696b4fd6151bb8ef23cbcdb66a2e7", "ja": "変……ですか？", "zh": "奇怪……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "23ada584548ccafb471533fbf55bedc55678cffb694c055e7d469992b9427e0f", "ja": "上手く説明できないんだけど……身近にいた、すごく\nにぎやかで楽しい人が、急にいなくなったような。", "zh": "我也说不太清楚……就好像身边那个既热闹又有趣的人，突然不见了一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "dfb0d9e2317ba22ccf83de4ecf08d799f76027a66755e74ae4bc435af3421bb6", "ja": "そんな感じがしているんだけど……。", "zh": "我就是有这样的感觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1036_009rit", "source_sha256": "145615ecde913dc9b83466c45d3724428100b6c05fdae358e0a0051d5190742e", "ja": "本来なら、ここは「急にどうしたんですか」って\n言うべきなんでしょうけど……何となくわかります。", "zh": "按理说，这时候应该说“您怎么突然这样了”，但……我大概能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "79b06f181a96606881af66741301276836dc8f0f4a8ec0b414cb3f4460e2556e", "ja": "そういえば……私も、何か変だなって思ってたのよ。\n順調なんだけど、何か物足りない、みたいな……。", "zh": "说起来……我也觉得有点不对劲。\n明明一切顺利，却总觉得缺了点什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1038_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fb46084461459c58d81b691d67416ec6a06fbc1fc0b42c6a9fa882455a00ff97", "ja": "私も、すこし寂しい気持ちになってました。\n……これも、何か関係あるんでしょうか？", "zh": "我也有点寂寞……。\n……这也和那件事有关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1039_009rit", "source_sha256": "621372e2c25a5fd4763d821c5101bb3ab2f9d31b7c75bd961f13982d6dc003f5", "ja": "とにかく、麗花さんだけにまかせておけませんし。\n追いかけましょう！", "zh": "总之，不能只拜托丽花小姐。\n我们追上去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "99d1c2da7b82386c9bb776acfb9efde4a509fc387c1aaebe481922b9764af1cf", "ja": "ああ。イベントも始まるしな。\n一刻も早く、ふたりを連れ戻そう！", "zh": "啊。活动也要开始了。\n我们尽快把两个人带回来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
